The character is intelligent and capable but has no formal astronaut training.

Their transformation into an astronaut must feel earned through gameplay.

They are not selected because of destiny, supernatural abilities, or an unrealistic prophecy.

They are selected because their engineering decisions demonstrate skills urgently needed for the ABSIDIAN mission.

